Backport of NVIDIA/nccl PR #2150 to v2.29.7-1.
Upstream: https://github.com/NVIDIA/nccl/pull/2150
Author: Harold Huang <baymaxhuang@gmail.com>
Upstream commit: ba31cff833979630ef2235b0d750658150d02789
Included in upstream NCCL 2.30.7.

Connect all contexts for each remote peer consecutively before self-loop QPs,
so round-robin RoCE LAG queue affinity can distribute payload traffic.
Additional MegaMOE fix: rotate the remote connection context order by sender
rank. This decorrelates LAG affinity across senders for fixed-context return
traffic, without changing logical QP indices or peer exchange contents.

